  "modelingNotes": [
    "Wynn Las Vegas: the curved bronze-glass hotel tower (2005, DeRuyter Butler with Jon Jerde). Procedural, CC0-1.0. bun generators/lv-wynn.ts",
    "Also the kit shared by this batch's curved towers (Encore, Fontainebleau, Resorts World, Trump): arc slabs, bevelled prisms, floor stripes and window bands. Importing this file builds nothing; running it writes models/lv-wynn.glb.",
